---
import TechnicalFigure from "./TechnicalFigure.astro";
---
<section id="flight-results" class="rocket-section rocket-results" aria-labelledby="rocket-results-heading">
  <div class="rocket-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FLIGHT RESULTS</p><h2 id="rocket-results-heading">measured in flight.</h2><p>Two flights from the project test program; comparison is reported as observed, not as a controlled experiment.</p></div>
  <div class="rocket-result-grid" aria-label="Flight metrics">
    <div><p>BASELINE FLIGHT</p><time datetime="2026-04-11">April 11, 2026</time><strong>5,867 <small>ft</small></strong></div>
    <div><p>FULL-DEPLOYMENT FLIGHT</p><time datetime="2026-04-12">April 12, 2026</time><strong>5,597 <small>ft</small></strong></div>
    <div class="rocket-result-delta"><p>REPORTED COMPARISON</p><strong>4.6% <small>lower apogee</small></strong></div>
  </div>
  <p class="rocket-result-caveat">Full airbrake deployment was demonstrated in flight. Predictive closed-loop target accuracy was not validated.</p>
  <div class="rocket-visual-pair">
  <TechnicalFigure src="/images/projects/rocket-airbrake/media/rocket-team-launchpad.webp" alt="Four-person project team beside the assembled rocket at the launch pad; the rocket extends beyond the top edge of the photograph." caption="Four-person capstone team · launch pad" width={781} height={1004}/>
  <TechnicalFigure src="/images/projects/rocket-airbrake/media/rocket-in-flight.webp" alt="Rocket ascending under motor thrust against a blue sky." caption="Rocket during powered ascent." width={174} height={662}/>
  </div>
</section>
